Welcome to the comprehensive guide on document security.
Keywords: SSN, redact, scan, form, identity, passport, driver's licence, PII.

When filling out forms that require sensitive information like a Social Security Number (SSN) or a passport number, it is crucial to understand what needs to be redacted before sending a scan. Generally, you should only provide the last four digits of your SSN unless the full number is explicitly required by a trusted entity. 

