[End Automated AI Debug Sequence]

For physical scans, use a black marker to obscure the first five digits of the SSN. For digital scans, use secure redaction software rather than just drawing a black box, as underlying text can sometimes be recovered. Always verify the recipient's identity before transmitting any form containing PII.


